s="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon text-token-text-primary"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-c62f0d15.svg#19c64a" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div></div><div data-task-list-drag-label="Reorder checklist item" class="mt4SwW_editor [--wb-text-primary:var(--text-primary)] [--wb-text-secondary:var(--text-secondary)] [--wb-text-tertiary:var(--text-tertiary)] [--wb-surface-primary:var(--bg-primary)] [--wb-surface-secondary:var(--bg-tertiary)] [--wb-border:rgb(0_0_0/7%)] [--wb-border-hover:rgb(0_0_0/7%)] [--wb-divider:var(--border-light)] [--wb-focus:var(--border-strong)] [--wb-control-border:var(--interactive-border-focus)] [--wb-entity-accent:var(--theme-entity-accent)] [--wb-accent:var(--interactive-label-accent-default)] [--wb-on-accent:var(--bg-primary)] [--wb-interactive-background:var(--interactive-bg-accent-default)] [--wb-selection:var(--theme-user-selection-bg,var(--selection))] [--wb-radius-sm:var(--radius-sm)] [--wb-shadow-lg:var(--shadow-lg)] [--wb-font-sans:var(--font-sans)] [--wb-font-mono:var(--font-mono)] [--wb-shimmer-dark-contrast:var(--gray-550)] [--wb-shimmer-dark-secondary:var(--text-tertiary)] [--wb-radius:24px] [--wb-shadow:0_4px_80px_rgb(0_0_0/2%)] [contain:none] writing-block-editor markdown-new-styling relative flow-root" style="--oai-wb-spacing: var(--spacing,0.25rem); --oai-wb-text-primary: var(--wb-text-primary,var(--color-token-text-primary,var(--text-primary,#0d0d0d))); --oai-wb-text-secondary: var(--wb-text-secondary,var(--color-token-text-secondary,var(--text-secondary,#5d5d5d))); --oai-wb-text-tertiary: var(--wb-text-tertiary,var(--color-token-text-tertiary,var(--text-tertiary,#8f8f8f))); --oai-wb-surface-primary: var(--wb-surface-primary,var(--color-token-main-surface-primary,var(--main-surface-primary,#fff))); --oai-wb-surface-secondary: var(--wb-surface-secondary,var(--color-token-bg-tertiary,var(--main-surface-secondary,#f5f5f5))); --oai-wb-interactive-secondary-hover: var(--wb-interactive-secondary-hover,var(--color-token-interactive-bg-secondary-hover,var(--oai-wb-surface-secondary))); --oai-wb-border: var(--wb-border,var(--color-token-border,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/8%)))); --oai-wb-border-hover: var(--wb-border-hover,var(--color-token-border-default,var(--border-medium,rgb(0 0 0/12%)))); --oai-wb-divider: var(--wb-divider,var(--color-token-border-light,var(--border-light,rgb(0 0 0/5%)))); --oai-wb-focus: var(--wb-focus,var(--color-token-focus-border,var(--border-strong,#5b9dd9))); --oai-wb-control-border: var(--wb-control-border,var(--interactive-border-focus,var(--oai-wb-focus))); --oai-wb-entity-accent: var(--wb-entity-accent,var(--theme-entity-accent,var(--oai-wb-accent))); --oai-wb-accent: var(--wb-accent,var(--interactive-label-accent-default,#0285ff)); --oai-wb-on-accent: var(--wb-on-accent,var(--bg-primary,#fff)); --oai-wb-interactive-background: var(--wb-interactive-background,var(--interactive-bg-accent-default,color-mix(in srgb,#0285ff 12%,transparent))); --oai-wb-selection: var(--wb-selection,var(--theme-user-selection-bg,var(--selection,#93c5fd))); --oai-wb-radius: var(--wb-radius,1.5rem); --oai-wb-radius-sm: var(--wb-radius-sm,0.5rem); --oai-wb-shadow: var(--wb-shadow,0 4px 80px rgb(0 0 0/2%)); --oai-wb-shadow-lg: var(--wb-shadow-lg,0 10px 30px rgb(0 0 0/12%)); --oai-wb-font-sans: var(--wb-font-sans,var(--font-sans,sans-serif)); --oai-wb-font-mono: var(--wb-font-mono,var(--font-mono,monospace)); --oai-wb-font-size: var(--wb-font-size,0.875rem); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-contrast: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-contrast,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary)); --oai-wb-shimmer-dark-secondary: var(--wb-shimmer-dark-secondary,var(--oai-wb-text-tertiary)); --writing-block-editor-pt: 0px; --writing-block-editor-pr: calc(3 * var(--spacing)); --writing-block-editor-pb: calc(3 * var(--spacing)); --writing-block-editor-pl: calc(4 * var(--spacing));"><div class="outline-none data-[writing-block-fullscreen-editor]:min-h-[75vh] ProseMirror markdown prose writing-block-typography dark:prose-invert w-full min-h-6 break-words focus:outline-none" data-writing-block-fullscreen-editor-region="true" data-writing-block-fullscreen-editor-layout="inline" contenteditable="true" aria-disabled="false" dir="auto" translate="no"><h1><span>Urban Senses of Hong Kong</span></h1><p><span>An interactive map-based digital archive that explores Hong Kong through Cantopop, screen memories, local food, public transport and community-contributed stories.</span></p><p><a href="https://daisywuh.github.io/Urban-Senses-of-Hong-Kong/"><span>Explore the Live Project</span></a></p><h2><span>Project Overview</span></h2><p><span>Urban Senses of Hong Kong investigates how music, moving images, food and everyday journeys can shape our memories of a city.</span></p><p><span>Instead of presenting Hong Kong as a conventional geographic map, the project treats the city as an emotional and cultural archive. Visitors can navigate between different locations, discover their connections with Cantopop songs and screen culture, follow animated trams and ferries, explore local food, and contribute personal memories to the map.</span></p><p><span>The project combines cultural storytelling with interaction design and front-end development, transforming fragmented urban memories into an explorable digital experience.</span></p><h2><span>Key Features</span></h2><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Interactive map-based exploration of Hong Kong</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Location-based Cantopop and screen memories</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Animated Hong Kong trams and Star Ferry routes</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Illustrated icons representing local food and landmarks</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Historical and present-day visual comparisons</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Filterable categories of urban memories</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>User-contributed stories and photographs</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Responsive interface for desktop and mobile devices</span></p></li></ul><h2><span>Design Concept</span></h2><p><span>The visual language draws inspiration from Hong Kong’s coastline, mountainous landscape, public transport and everyday street culture.</span></p><p><span>A soft colour palette and illustrated interface elements create an approachable atmosphere, while the map provides a spatial structure for connecting different forms of media. The experience is designed to feel less like searching a database and more like wandering through collective memories of the city.</span></p><h2><span>Interaction</span></h2><p><span>Users can:</span></p><ol data-spread="false" start="1"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Explore memory points across the map.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Select different cultural categories.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Open location cards containing songs, images and stories.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Follow animated tram and ferry journeys.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>compare historical scenes with their present-day locations.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Add their own memories and photographs.</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Track how many locations they have illuminated.</span></p></li></ol><h2><span>Technologies</span></h2><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>HTML5</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>CSS3</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>JavaScript</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>MapLibre GL JS</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>GeoJSON</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Local browser storage</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>GitHub Pages</span></p></li></ul><h2><span>My Role</span></h2><p><span>This is an independently designed and developed project. I was responsible for:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p dir="auto"><span>Concept development and cultural research</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Information architecture</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Interaction and visual design</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Geographic data organisation</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Front-end development</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Map interactions and transport animation</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Image and media asset integration</span></p></li><li><p dir="auto"><span>Interface testing and refinement</span></p></li></ul><h2><span>Project Status</span></h2><p><span>The current version is a functional interactive prototype. Future development may include a larger cultural archive, account-based contributions, cloud data storage and additional accessibility features.</span></p><h2><span>Author</span></h2><p><strong><span>Daisy Hu</span></strong></p><p><span>Computer Science and Technology undergraduate interested in interactive media, digital storytelling and culturally informed experience design.</span></p><h2><span>License</span></h2><p><span>This project is licensed under the MIT License.</span></p></div></div></div><div data-writing-block-fullscreen-shell-border="true" aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] z-[2] [box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--oai-wb-border)] group-hover/writing-block-surface:[box-shadow:inset_0_0_0_1px_var(--oai-wb-border-hover)]"></div></div></div>
<p data-start="3360" data-end="3389">然后往下滑，在 <strong data-start="3368" data-end="3386">Commit changes</strong> 中：</p>
<ul data-start="3391" data-end="3492">
<li data-start="3391" data-end="3423">
<p data-start="3393" data-end="3423" class="" style="">第一格填写：<code data-start="3399" data-end="3423">Improve project README</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3424" data-end="3465">
<p data-start="3426" data-end="3465" class="" style="">选择：<code data-start="3429" data-end="3465">Commit directly to the main branch</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3466" data-end="3492">
<p data-start="3468" data-end="3492">点击绿色的 <strong data-start="3474" data-end="3492">Commit changes</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="3494" data-end="3563" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">有一个小地方我之后会帮你补：README 顶部需要加入一张效果最好的横版项目截图。我们先把文字提交，下一步再上传截图并插入 README。</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78516 9.06738 1.78516H15.1006ZM4.90039 7.28223C3.94218 7.28223 3.16504 8.05936 3.16504 9.01758V15.0508C3.16544 16.0087 3.942